This directory contains photon data files broken into weeklong intervals.  It is updated as new data comes in.  

You can use wget to download the weekly files with the following command:
wget -m -P . -nH --cut-dirs=4 -np -e robots=off https://heasarc.gsfc.nasa.gov/FTP/fermi/data/lat/weekly/photon/

If your downloaded file seems corrupted, the file may have been updated while you were downloading it.  Please try downloading it again.
